---
import Experience from '../layouts/Experience.astro';
import { orgs } from '../data/profile';
---

<Experience org={orgs.keybank}>
  <p>
    I joined a brand-new team formed to stand up an internal application for
    KeyBank bankers: a tool that lets a banker open a small-business account for
    a client who walks into the branch in about ten minutes, down from the hour
    or more it used to take. It's built in <strong>Angular</strong> and <strong
      >TypeScript</strong
    >, and it grew from an empty repository into
    a platform now used by <strong>1,500+ bankers</strong> nationwide.
  </p>

  <p>
    I wrote the first commit on the project. I set up the formatting and linting
    rules, laid out the initial structure, and built the services that talk to
    the backend and feed data into the form-based application bankers fill out
    for each client.
  </p>

  <p>
    Over time I grew into a lead role. I had a heavy hand in the product
    roadmap and became the bridge between engineering and our product owner,
    translating what was technically possible and how feasible it was against
    our release timeline. I also reviewed the work of our three+ frontend
    engineers.
  </p>

  <p>
    After three years building that platform, I was chosen to off-ramp and join
    a new greenfield team building the first AI capabilities at the bank. We
    build <strong>AI agents</strong> for internal KeyBank employees
    to help with their day-to-day work, and we're now expanding that into a
    platform for everything AI at the bank. It's the most exciting work I've
    done here, and I'm learning a lot.
  </p>
</Experience>
